+| workshop part change | 23.4 (37.9 / 39.4 ms; 2:8 3:15) | **30.0** (22.0 / 27.0 ms; 2:30) |
+| workshop armory | 26.7 (34.2 / 35.1 ms; 2:60 3:20) | **30.0** (21.0 / 25.5 ms; 2:90) |
